      <tr>
        <td>5</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL" target="_blank">PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_URL</a></td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">string</a> url</td>
        <td>Used to get or set the parcel&#39;s media url.</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>10</td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_TYPE" target="_blank">PARCEL_MEDIA_COMMAND_TYPE</a></td>
        <td><a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/String" target="_blank">string</a> mime_type</td>
        <td>Used to get or set the parcel media MIME type (e.g. &quot;text/html&quot;). (1.19.1 RC0 or later)</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
